# Pairs with NoKeyLost. Transfer removes a donor row without storing the sibling copy.
MODULE: MoveDropsKey
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a split transfer drops an acknowledged key
PERTURBS: Move

--- FIND
Move(k) ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ born
    /\ k \in donorRows
    /\ k \in Moving
    /\ donorRows' = donorRows \ {k}
    /\ siblingRows' = siblingRows \cup {k}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: omit the sibling copy.
Move(k) ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ born
    /\ k \in donorRows
    /\ k \in Moving
    /\ donorRows' = donorRows \ {k}
    /\ siblingRows' = siblingRows
--- END
